      "Bash(sed -i 's|\\\\[\\\\[../engine/ENGINE_REPAIR|[[../engine/archive/ENGINE_REPAIR|g; s|\\\\[\\\\[engine/ENGINE_REPAIR|[[engine/archive/ENGINE_REPAIR|g; s|docs/engine/ENGINE_REPAIR\\\\.md|docs/engine/archive/ENGINE_REPAIR.md|g' docs/index.md docs/GEMINI_OFFLOAD.md docs/OAKLAND_SPORTS_FEED.md docs/adr/0005-rollout-plan-structure.md .claude/skills/doc-audit/SKILL.md docs/plans/*.md docs/research/*.md)",
