      "Bash(timeout 90 npx supermemory remember \"GodWorld shared memory container: ALL lanes \\(Claude terminals media/civic/engine-sheet/research-build + non-Claude CLIs kimi/codex/grok/antigravity\\) save and search ONE Supermemory container, tag sl-godworld, as of 2026-08-15 S372. One brain, different reasoning models. Per-lane sl-<lane> tags are frozen history — query by old tag for history only, never write to one. Hand-write only: one fact per save, never pipe session logs/transcripts/diffs \\(bulk dumps get chunked and bury deliberate writes\\). Never auto-pulled at boot; search on demand. Session logs still auto-mirror to the separate session-logs container. Wired in: .claude/hooks/session-startup-hook.sh boot line, .claude/skills/session-end/SKILL.md, scripts/sessionSummaryToSupermemory.js comments, docs/SUPERMEMORY.md Terminal Tagging section, AGENTS.md 'Shared memory' section \\(house-guest boot doc\\).\" --tag sl-godworld --static)",
